luded 21,407 dyads for missing skin tone ratings (no player photo)", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone", "exclusions"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 29, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[39, 39]], "assertion": "excluded 9,164 dyads for missing covariates (position, height, weight, referee country bias)", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["covariates", "exclusions"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 30, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[40, 40]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 31, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[41, 41]], "note": "subheading Exposure Definition"}, {"id": 32, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[42, 42]], "assertion": "defined 'dark skin' as skin tone ≥0.375 on the 0-1 scale", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone", "dark skin"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [33]}, {"id": 33, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[42, 42]], "assertion": "27.6% of the analysis sample was classified as dark-skinned", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["dark skin"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [32]}, {"id": 34, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[43, 43]], "assertion": "the skin tone score was computed as the average of two independent raters' ratings", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone", "rater1", "rater2"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [35]}, {"id": 35, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[43, 43]], "assertion": "the inter-rater correlation was r=0.92", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["rater1", "rater2"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [34]}, {"id": 36, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[44, 44]], "assertion": "rescaled the original 5-point skin tone scale (0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1.0) to a 0-1 scale", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 37, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[45, 45]], "assertion": "the 0.375 cutpoint separates 'light/very light' (0-0.25) from 'medium/dark/very dark' (0.375-1.0)", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone cutpoint"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [38, 39]}, {"id": 38, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[45, 45]], "assertion": "the cutpoint was selected via specification search specifically because it yielded the strongest effect size (RD=0.185pp, p=0.013)", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone cutpoint"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": [37, 39]}, {"id": 39, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[45, 45]], "assertion": "the chosen cutpoint is characterized as defensible, being a natural midpoint between the two lightest categories and the darker categories", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["skin tone cutpoint"], "confidence": "low", "shares_lines_with": [37, 38]}, {"id": 40, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[46, 46]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 41, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[47, 47]], "note": "subheading Outcome"}, {"id": 42, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[48, 48]], "assertion": "defined the outcome as a binary indicator equal to 1 if at least one red card occurred in the dyad, 0 otherwise", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["outcome", "red card"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 43, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[49, 49]], "assertion": "1,455 dyads (1.26%) had at least one red card", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["red card"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 44, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[50, 50]], "assertion": "crude red card rates were 1.22% for light-skinned and 1.38% for dark-skinned players, a crude RD of 0.16pp", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["red card", "skin tone"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 45, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[51, 51]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 46, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[52, 52]], "note": "subheading Covariates (Adjusted Model)"}, {"id": 47, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[53, 53]], "note": "label P